# Without this file the build context is ~1.4 GB — .pixi alone is 940 MB and
# node_modules another 420 MB — all of it re-sent to the daemon on every build
# and all of it reinstalled inside the image anyway.
.pixi/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs: the builder stage compiles its own. Copying host artifacts in
# would ship Darwin .node files into a Linux image.
**/build/*.node
**/build/*.dylib
**/build/*.so

.git/
.github/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Regenerable or environment-specific
packages/embed/fixtures/
examples/rag-demo/fixtures/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
